{'symbol': 'TER', 'date': '2021-10-26 17:01:00', 'title': 'TERADYNE REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': "NORTH READING, MASS., OCT. 26, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TERADYNE, INC. (NASDAQ: TER) REPORTED REVENUE OF $951 MILLION FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2021 OF WHICH $688 MILLION WAS IN SEMICONDUCTOR TEST, $103 MILLION IN SYSTEM TEST, $69 MILLION IN WIRELESS TEST AND $91 MILLION IN INDUSTRIAL AUTOMATION (IA). GAAP NET INCOME FOR THE THIRD QUARTER WAS $256.7 MILLION OR $1.41 PER DILUTED SHARE. ON A NON-GAAP BASIS, TERADYNE'S NET INCOME IN THE THIRD QUARTER WAS $278.6 MILLION, OR $1.59 PER DILUTED SHARE, WHICH EXCLUDED LOSSES ON CONVERTIBLE DEBT CONVERSIONS, ACQUIRED INTANGIBLE ASSET AMORTIZATION, RESTRUCTURING AND OTHER CHARGES, NON-CASH CONVERTIBLE DEBT INTEREST, DISCRETE TAX ADJUSTMENTS AND INCLUDED THE RELATED TAX IMPACT ON NON-GAAP ADJUSTMENTS."}